## The Only Version of This Manicure Worth Getting Is the Right One for You

The french tip almond nail works because it is structurally elegant the shape and the finish reinforce each other in a way that requires almost no decoration to look intentional. The mistake most people make is copying a reference without accounting for their nail length, skin tone, or how long they want it to last.

Book the micro tip if you have shorter nails or want something that grows out beautifully. Choose chrome if you want a finish that genuinely earns attention. Go coloured if white feels too predictable but you want to stay within the format. And if you are heading to a salon, bring references not just the finished look, but the base tone and tip width you want. The more specific you are, the more precisely you will get back what you actually want.
